      source: "Studio portrait photograph of Aurel Stein, 1909, attributed to John Thomson of The Grosvenor Studios, London; Wellcome Collection work hvb3kf2k (reference 13621i, Miro image V0027218), titled 'Sir Aurel Stein. Photograph by J. Thomson, The Grosvenor Studios, 1909.' Downscaled from the library's 2360 x 3124 IIIF original to 755 x 1000; not cropped and not upscaled.",
