      source: "Oval studio photograph of Nishi Amane (photographer not named) shown on the National Diet Library, Japan, site 'Portraits of Modern Japanese Historical Figures' (NISHI Amane, first of two portraits, file 0309_1.jpg, 1281 x 1760 pixels), taken from the frontispiece plate of Asō Yoshiteru (ed.), Nishi Amane tetsugaku chosakushu (Tokyo: Iwanami Shoten, 1933), NDL Digital Collections item 1176475 (rights status 'out of copyright'; item record linked to the Portraits page). The file is the site's own image downscaled to 728 x 1000 with no upscaling and no other change.",
