      licenseUrl: "https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/mark/1.0/",
      attribution: "Anonymous photographer, portrait of Tiyo Soga, albumen print, c. 1866-1871, frontispiece of Chalmers's 'Tiyo Soga' (1877); Rijksmuseum, Amsterdam, RP-F-2001-7-367-1 (cropped and downscaled).",
      attributionUrl: "https://www.rijksmuseum.nl/en/collection/RP-F-2001-7-367-1",
