      source: "Studio portrait photograph of Waldemar Mordecai Wolffe Haffkine, Wellcome Collection catalogue record as9gafvt (library reference 12858i, image V0026503, catalogued as 'Waldemar Mordecai Wolffe Haffkine. Photograph.', subject authority Waldemar Haffkine). The file is the holder's own IIIF image (2244 x 3308) downscaled to 678 x 1000; no upscaling and none of the later retouching on the Wikimedia Commons copy. Identity: the holder names him in the title and subject record, and the face matches the portrait printed as Figure 1 of Hawgood (2007) captioned 'Dr Waldemar Mordecai Haffkine' (Royal Society of Medicine); the print itself bears no inscription.",
